Project: Leeds Manhunt

Long-term goal:
A Unity-based outdoor manhunt game supporting up to 250 players.

First playable target:
10–20 players in one bounded playing area.

Current milestone:
Run a Unity app on a physical phone, then display a small
3D campus map with simulated player markers.

Not building yet:
Authentication, multiplayer networking, captures,
background tracking, custom building models or city-wide gameplay.